        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Closing: this is not a prerequisite for #40897. Conceal-aware wrap reflows static conceal without query-change notification; only runtime mutation of an active query needs it, and #40897 no longer depends on this branch.\n\nThe underlying callback leak is real, but as noted in review it belongs in `LanguageTree:destroy()` rather than in highlighter-side bookkeeping. Better raised separately on its own merits.",
